  m_text: 'Your guests arrive in <b>6 minutes</b> and the isombe isn''t started.

    Cook
    it one step at a time. The kitchen lights up where you''re needed,

    and the
    walls hold the clues.


    Wrong moves cost time. If the clock runs out, dinner
    burns.'
